      "_stats": {},
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>You imbue a weapon you touch with holy power. Until the spell ends the weapon emits bright light in a 30-foot radius and dim light for a further 30 feet, and attacks with it deal an extra 2d8 radiant damage on a hit. If the weapon is not already magical, it becomes so for the duration.</p><p>As a bonus action on a later turn you can dismiss the spell early and cause the weapon to burst with radiance. Each creature of your choice within 30 feet of it must make a Constitution saving throw, taking 4d8 radiant damage on a failure and being blinded for 1 minute, or half as much damage on a success and not being blinded. A blinded creature repeats the save at the end of each of its turns, ending the effect on itself on a success.</p><p><strong>Classes:</strong> Paladin. <strong>Rules:</strong> D&amp;D 5e (2014).</p>",
          "chat": ""
        },
